  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Reclaim a milestone the builder did not deliver in time.\\n\\nOnly after the deadline, and never once the reviewer has approved \\xe2\\x80\\x94 an\\napproved milestone is owed to the builder regardless of the clock.",
