    }
  },
  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Pay an approved milestone out to the builder.\\n\\nThe reviewer-controlled payout path. Requires the reviewer's signature\\nand an `Approved` status \\xe2\\x80\\x94 no score or recommendation can reach this\\nline. After that human approval, `claim` is the builder's recovery path.",
